    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nA superb family home beautifully presented, ideally located and ready to move into. \n\nSherry FitzGerald Royal is delighted to introduce this exceptional four-bedroom detached residence to the market, ideally positioned within the highly regarded Edgeworth Court development in Longwood.\n\nBuilt in 2005 and presented in immaculate condition throughout, this spacious two-storey home combines generous accommodation with an attractive brick façade, excellent natural light and a high standard of finish. Overlooking a well-maintained green area to the front, the property enjoys a pleasant setting within this established development.\n\nThe accommodation is well laid out for modern family life and comprises entrance hall, sitting room, kitchen/dining room, utility room, guest WC, living room, four bedrooms, ensuite and family bathroom.\n\nAt the heart of the home is the generous kitchen/dining area, while the separate sitting room and living room provide excellent flexibility for family life, entertaining and relaxation. All appliances are included in the sale, allowing the new owners to settle in with ease.\n\nUpstairs, there are four well-proportioned bedrooms, including a principal bedroom with ensuite, with fitted wardrobes providing excellent storage.\n\nOutside, the property benefits from a large rear garden with paved patio area, ideal for outdoor dining, entertaining or simply enjoying the garden. A steel garden shed provides additional storage.\n\nB Rated Energy Efficient Home with Potential Green Mortgage Benefits\n\nThe property has achieved a B - BER, reflecting a good level of energy efficiency. A B-rated home can provide lower energy consumption and heating costs, while also offering greater comfort throughout the year.\n\nIt may also qualify for green mortgage rates with participating lenders, potentially providing purchasers with access to more favourable mortgage rates, subject to individual lender criteria. Purchasers should confirm availability and applicable terms directly with their mortgage provider.\n\nAn Excellent Family Location\nThe location is a particular highlight. Edgeworth Court is a mature, modern development within easy walking distance of Longwood village, with a range of local amenities and services close by. For families, the availability of newly built primary and secondary schools, both approximately five minutes by car, adds significantly to the appeal of the location.\n\nLongwood also offers excellent connectivity to surrounding towns and Dublin. Enfield railway station provides rail access, while the M4 and M50 are readily accessible, making commuting to Dublin and the surrounding areas convenient.\nThe larger towns of Enfield, Kilcock, Maynooth and Trim are also within easy reach, offering further shopping, recreational, educational and employment opportunities.\n\nProperties offering detached accommodation, generous gardens, excellent presentation and such a convenient location are rarely available.\n\nWhether you are a growing family seeking additional space, a purchaser looking for a home that requires little or nothing to do, or a commuter seeking an attractive base within easy reach of Dublin, this property is sure to appeal.\n\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the quality, space and excellent standard of this impressive home.\nThis is much more than a house it is a home ready for its next chapter."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nComposite front door, tiled floor, alarm keypad, understairs closet.\n\nSitting Room - \nMedia wall with TV speakers & electric plazma fire, fitted wall shelving & storage, window seat with storage underneath, laminate floor, ceiling coving.\n\nKitchen/Dining - \nRange of wall and floor fitted units, Beko fridge/freezer, Bosh dishwasher, Leisure 1000m range type cooker with 2 ovens, grill and 5 ring gas hob with electric side plate, Belling cooker hood over, tiled over countertop, tiled floor, french doors to garden and patio.\n\nUtility - \nCountertop with Hotpoint washing machine & Hotpoint dryer, fitted wall shelving, tiled floor.\n\nGuest WC - \nWC, Wash-hand basin with storage underneath , tiled floor, radiator cover.\n\nLiving/Family Room - \nLaminate floor.\n\nLanding - \nBuilt-in hotpress, carpeted floor.\n\nMain Bedroom - \nFitted 2 door wardrobe, wall panelling behind bed.\n\nEn-Suite - \nCorne shower, Mira Elite SE electric shower, heated towel rail, WC, Wash-hand basin with storage under, wall mounted mirror, fully tiled walls and floor.\n\nBedroom 2 - \nCarpeted floor, built-in 3 door wardrobe.\n\nBedroom 3 - \nCarpeted floor, built in 3 door wardrobe.\n\nBedroom 4 - \nFitted wall storage, laminate floor.\n\nBathroom - \nPanelled bath with shower over, WC, Wash-hand basin with wall mounted mirror over, fitted storage cupboard, heated shower rail, fully tiled walls and floor.\n\n"
      },
